	{"name":"B","upstreams":["R"]},
	{"name":"R","upstreams":[]},
	{"name":"Z","upstreams":[]},
	{"name":"S","upstreams":[]}
]}`

// snapshotForTrace writes graphJSON to a graph file, snapshots it, and
